**/.env.*

# === IDE / Editor ===
.vscode
.idea
.yarn

# === Test / Coverage ===
coverage
**/coverage

# === Misc ===
.DS_Store
local-data
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# === Infra (CDK コードは Lambda イメージに不要) ===
infra

